    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,</p><p>Area of parallelogram&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</